@startuml
title Prompt Planning - Detail

skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

participant "Planner" as Planner
database "Raw corpus" as Raw
participant "Category + difficulty policy" as Policy
participant "PromptBuilder" as Builder
participant "Source compactor" as Compactor
database "prompts.jsonl" as Prompts

Planner -> Raw : select pilot, subset, or full documents
Planner -> Policy : assign category and difficulty
Planner -> Builder : document + assignments
Builder -> Compactor : derive prompt-only evidence view
Compactor --> Builder : compacted source
Builder -> Builder : combine base, task, source, content templates
Builder --> Prompts : write complete prompt plan

@enduml
